   "text": "MAINS lost, restored, 60 s alarm\nBOOT each start: cause, slot\nFIRMWARE kept, rolled back\nSETTINGS from web page or menu\nWEB admin logged in\nNETWORK link, IPv4 address\nLLDP switch port changed\nUPDATE check-ins fail / work",
