   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Severity: notice, warning, error or critical; HOSTNAME is the device's hostname, timestamps are UTC.\nEvents are dated from the time they happened, so the queue can wait for the clock without losing it.\nNeither server is built in: with none set, the device contacts no NTP or syslog server.",
   "originalText": "Severity: notice, warning, error or critical; HOSTNAME is the device's hostname, timestamps are UTC.\nEvents are dated from the time they happened, so the queue can wait for the clock without losing it.\nNeither server is built in: with none set, the device contacts no NTP or syslog server.",
   "fontSize": 16,
